This plugin bundles skills adapted from several upstream projects. Each retains
its own license; the repository-root NOTICE file carries the full attribution and
third-party license text. Sources include:

- ag-kit (https://github.com/vudovn/ag-kit), Copyright (c) 2026 VUDOVN, MIT.
- antigravity-marketing (https://github.com/nguyenphp/antigravity-marketing),
  Copyright (c) NguyenPHP, MIT.
- ClaudeKit (https://github.com/mrgoonie/claudekit-skills), MIT — source of the
  `brand` and `banner-design` skills.
- MiniMax-AI/skills (https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/skills), Copyright (c) 2026
  MiniMax, MIT — source of the `minimax-pdf` skill.
- Remotion Dev Skills (https://github.com/remotion-dev/skills) — source of
  `remotion-best-practices`, vendored from commit
  1af7e69a2a613437d46095924057970a6a7df40d (2026-11-09, v4.0.542). The upstream repo
  states no license (GitHub: NOASSERTION). Remotion itself is distributed under the
  Remotion License (https://github.com/remotion-dev/remotion/blob/main/LICENSE.md),
  which requires a paid Company License for some organizations. The skill text
  remains (c) Remotion and is included without a separate license grant. Installers are
  responsible for complying with Remotion's licensing when using Remotion.
- ai-marketing-claude (https://github.com/zubair-trabzada/ai-marketing-claude),
  Copyright (c) 2026 Zubair Trabzada, MIT — source of the `client-proposal` skill.
- agentkits-marketing (https://github.com/aitytech/agentkits-marketing),
  Copyright (c) AityTech, MIT — source of the `form-cro` skill and of reference
  guides kept under "Kit additions" in `schema`, `free-tools`, `competitors`,
  `pricing`, `cro`, `emails`, `seo-audit`, and `ab-testing`, plus the ideas and
  levers merged into the pre-1.0.0 `marketing-ideas` / `marketing-psychology`
  bodies kept under their Kit additions.
- marketingskills (https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills),
  Copyright (c) Corey Haines, MIT — source of all 53 skills that carry an
  upstream marketingskills name (vendored verbatim since aak-marketing 1.0.0;
  see NOTICE). Upstream `copywriting` adapts material from Profound's
  `improved-copywriting` and `humanizer` skills
  (https://github.com/retieedra-profound/skills-marketing-library, MIT).
- Brand-building-skills (https://github.com/arnabbagxd/Brand-building-skills),
  Copyright (c) 2026 Arnab Bag, MIT — source of the `brand-naming`,
  `brand-architecture`, `brand-measurement`, `brand-packaging`, `brand-manifesto`,
  `personal-brand`, `ugc-strategy`, and `whatsapp-marketing` skills, and of grafted
  reference guides in `branding-expert`, `influencer-marketing`, `competitor-profiling`,
  `aso`, `ads`, `marketing-plan`, `email-marketing`,
  `co-marketing`, and `sales-enablement`.

See the NOTICE file at the repository root for the full third-party license text.
